   "time": "-79239513600/1",
   "metadata": {
    "title": "Nabonidus digs up Naram-Sin's foundation",
    "description": "Rebuilding the temple of Shamash at **Sippar**, **Nabonidus** digs down to an inscription of **Naram-Sin**, which, he wrote, no king before him had seen for 3,200 years. The real gap was about 1,700 years; he was out by some 1,500.",
    "tags": [
     "writing",
     "building"
    ],
    "sources": [
     "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nabonidus",
